flowchart LR
    Q[Natural language question]
    Plan[Planning & route selection]
    SQL[Generated SQL + explanation]
    Run[SQL Warehouse execution]
    Answer[Streaming summary & table/chart]
    Validate[Validation accordion<br/>SQL review & curation]
    Feedback[Thumbs up / down feedback]
    Trace[MLflow trace link]

    Q --> Plan --> SQL --> Run --> Answer
    SQL --> Validate
    Answer --> Feedback
    Plan --> Trace
    SQL --> Trace
    Run --> Trace
    Feedback --> Trace

    classDef input fill:#E8F4FD,stroke:#1B6EC2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef output fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D4E,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef observe fill:#F5A623,stroke:#C17D11,stroke-width:2px

    class Q input
    class Plan,SQL,Run process
    class Answer output
    class Validate,Feedback,Trace observe
